WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Use a light eraser on a dry surface.
Bring the destination close.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Approach, grasp, lift a little, place.
Use the hand and grasp that work for you.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Rest. Sliding or a larger block is an option.
Do not reach to catch a dropped object.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Example replay: watch each stage.
Keep the movement close to your body.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Pause. A tight pinch is not required.
Ask an OT to adapt difficult stages.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Final replay: lower before releasing.
Repetition is optional, not a target.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Rest. Note the help or adaptation you used.
Do not continue through pain or fatigue.
